The `statechart` skill in this directory adapts substantial portions of the
statechart skill from pstack — https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack
— which is distributed under the MIT License. Its copyright and permission
notice is retained below, as MIT requires.

This notice covers the adapted procedure (from-spec / from-chart, reader-word
labels, each bug as a numbered path, replay on real entry points). FSD-specific
scope — orchestration Task status, holds, notice records, and the
`issue-multi-pr.js` assemble phase — is part of this repository and carries its
own LICENSE. The TLC/Java scripts stay upstream; this skill does not vendor them.

